  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF-Norway Disability Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a strategic, cross-cutting support to strengthening UNICEF&#x2019;s work on including persons with disabilities across UNICEF&#x2019;s strategic plan. The aim of the programme is to reach more persons with disabilities, strengthen and expand programming for persons with disabilities in the implementation of UNICEFs strategic plan for the period 2018-2021.</narrative>
  </description>
